%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: uncoloured pattern with components. The instance is set
% through the pattern space over DeviceRGB with red under it; the fill
% names the pattern with its components, and the cell carries no colour
% of its own.
/U << /PatternType 1 /PaintType 2 /TilingType 1 /BBox [0 0 10 10]
  /XStep 10 /YStep 10 /PaintProc { pop 0 0 5 5 rectfill } >> matrix makepattern def
[/Pattern /DeviceRGB] setcolorspace
1 0 0 U setcolor
100 100 200 100 rectfill
showpage
